# Typescript/Javascript/React Projects

## Project Setup & Tooling
- Always use **Bun** instead of npm for package management
- Use the latest version of NextJS with App Router and React for all React projects
- Use the latest version of Tailwind CSS


## Code Style & Patterns
- **Function components**: Always use function declarations, not arrow functions for components
- **Optional chaining**: Use `?.` liberally for safe property access
- **Nullish coalescing**: Use `??` for default values
- **Comments**: Add explanatory comments for complex logic or performance optimizations. Omit when not needed.

